-- What the informal proofs of sag/zmt-weighted4 open, declaration by
-- declaration (seg/WRITING.md, rule 6), for 58 central declarations.
-- Each list was compared with the file comment of its declaration.
-- Besides the notions each proof is about (pr, proj, lowerZ, projL, sumL,
-- Wit, Step, ev, evc, mulP, ...), the lists contain
--   * carriers: Chart.mod/El/Raw/RawM, SubMod.E, powM, regular, TPoly,
--     Prod.El, Trunc.carrier/image ('an element of C(k) is a finitely
--     supported family');
--   * in GradingStep (R[U]) and in the regressions over D_2, the quotient
--     ring and its operation aliases (K, Carrier, Q, S, ring, addQ, mulQ,
--     operation, Quot.choose/induction/map): the CRing fields of
--     Extension.ring are identified with the quotient operations by
--     unfolding the aliases of PolynomialRing, as in sag/zmt-syzygies4
--     (at most 0.06 s);
--   * 'by definition of the tower': D (t+1) = D_t[U] (tower, S, ring), and
--     in GradingStep.ev-var the aliases of Universal.Given.extend.
CoefficientParts.Laws.pr-zero: regular
CoefficientParts.Laws.hom-other: Hom
CoefficientParts.Laws.hom-mul: Hom
CoefficientParts.Laws.pr-mul-left: Hom
CoefficientParts.Laws.expr-value: Expr Hom expr regular sum value zeroZ
CoefficientParts.Laws.value-hom: Expr Hom add addP sucZ sum value zeroZ
CoefficientParts.sub-lower: add lowerZ minus neg subZ toB
